<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112251" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράτρ-ιος</span></b> , 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρητρ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράτρα,</span> at Athens, epith. of Zeus
			and Athena, as <i>tutelary deities of the phratriae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				302d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					43.14
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1237.1
			</span></i>, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φρατόριος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.Jun.
				9.5
			</span></i>; also at Syros, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).669
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποτειδὰν ὁ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					323
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				14
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ θεοὶ οἱ φρήτριοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.759
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Naples</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Röm.Mitt.</u>
				27.303
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aquila</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράτριον</span></b> , τό, <i>a temple of these deities,</i> or <i>any
				shrine used by the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρατρία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρατρία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.52
			</span></i> codd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράτριος μήν, ὁ,</span> name of month at Cyme, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.1302.54
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i B. C.</span><span class="entity">/i A. D.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
